  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the snow peas and cook until tender, about 2 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the fish sauce, soy sauce, turmeric, black pepper, and salt.",
    "Pour the sauce over the snow peas and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 1 minute, until the sauce is bubbly and slightly thickened.",
    "Serve the stir fry in a Korean brass bowl and enjoy."
